d":"chr_isolde_vane","target_character_id":"chr_orrin_halk","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Isolde Vane brings the message to Orrin Halk for decoding; their uneasy partnership is strained by his secrecy and her scepticism."},{"id":"rel_orrin_isolde_mentor","source_character_id":"chr_orrin_halk","target_character_id":"chr_isolde_vane","relationship_type":"mentor","description":"Orrin Halk teaches Isolde Vane to read the patterns behind the skybridge network, challenging her reliance on only measurable facts."},{"id":"rel_tamsin_brannock_toll","source_character_id":"chr_tamsin_reeve","target_character_id":"chr_brannock_dray","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Tamsin Reeve opposes Brannock Dray's rising skybridge tolls in the Toll War, and each tries to outmanoeuvre the other over control of the bridges."},{"id":"rel_tamsin_isolde_ally","source_character_id":"chr_tamsin_reeve","target_character_id":"chr_isolde_vane","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Tamsin Reeve shelters Isolde Vane at Emberroost and supplies safe bridge passage in exchange for the message's evidence."},{"id":"rel_wren_isolde_apprentice","source_character_id":"chr_wren_alder","target_character_id":"chr_isolde_vane","relationship_type":"friend","description":"Wren Alder befriends Isolde Vane and acts as her apprentice, while Isolde's guarded nature tests the bond."},{"id":"rel_brannock_wren_levy","source_character_id":"chr_brannock_dray","target_character_id":"chr_wren_alder","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Brannock Dray enforces the Grain Levy against Wren Alder's family and treats her petition as a nuisance to be quietly crushed."}]}
