hed scholar to a guide who admits her hidden knowledge, giving up her research to save others.","personality_traits":["precise","secretive","brilliant","detached"],"abilities":[{"name":"Skybridge Cartography","description":"Can chart shifting routes and predict drift paths from fragments of data.","category":"mental"}]},{"id":"chr_corvin_hale","name":"Corvin Hale","description":"A silver-tongued Cartel enforcer from Mistral Docks, broad and immaculately dressed even in the damp, with a signet ring marking Cartel authority. He is aboard to ensure the crew's cargo reaches his masters.","role":"antagonist","home_location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","faction_id":"fac_drift_cartel","motivation":"To seize the liner's cargo for the Cartel and earn a seat among its merchant princes.","goal":"Take the strongbox for himself and leave the crew behind to cover his tracks.","flaw":"Greed and arrogance make him believe he can bargain with anything, even what haunts the ship.","internal_conflict":"He privately fears the Cartel will discard him as readily as the crew, yet he cannot stop serving it.","external_conflict":"Mara's resistance blocks his plan, and the ship's inhabitants prey on those who hoard.","arc":"Corvin's greed draws him deeper into the ship's grasp. He makes a final bargain with the haunting that exposes the cost of his ambition.","personality_traits":["charming","ruthless","calculating","vain"],"abilities":[{"name":"Silver Tongue","description":"Persuades and intimidates through polished negotiation.","category":"social"}]},{"id":"chr_wren_tallow","name":"Wren Tallow","description":"A quiet young deckhand from The Hollow, small and sun-browned from mill work, who signed on for coin to send home. Sensitive to things others miss, she hears whispers in the fog before anyone else.","role":"supporting","home_location_id":"loc_the_hollow","faction_id":"fac_hollow_circle","motivation":"To earn enough to save her family's mill from the Cartel's grain levy.","goal":"Survive the voyage and carry her wages home to The Hollow.","flaw":"Fear makes her freeze and defer to stronger voices, even when she knows they are wrong.","internal_conflict":"She is afraid of what she hears in the fog, yet feels drawn to it as if it knows her name.","external_conflict":"Corvin, a Cartel agent, represents the very levy threatening her family, while the ship's voices target her.","arc":"Wren moves from frightened follower to the one who trusts her gift, leading the crew through the fog by listening.","personality_traits":["timid","observant","kind","sensitive"],"abilities":[{"name":"Fog Whispers","description":"Hears faint voices and warnings carried within the fog.","category":"supernatural"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_mara_corvin_debt","source_character_id":"chr_mara_voss","target_character_id":"chr_corvin_hale","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Mara Voss owes a heavy wind-debt to the Drift Cartel, and Corvin Hale, its enforcer, uses that debt to command her while plotting to take the strongbox she needs to buy freedom."},{"id":"rel_corvin_mara_leash","source_character_id":"chr_corvin_hale","target_character_id":"chr_mara_voss","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Corvin Hale sees Mara Voss as the only crew member capable of blocking his claim to the cargo and plans to sacrifice her crew to keep her compliant."},{"id":"rel_mara_tobin_mentor","source_character_id":"chr_mara_voss","target_character_id":"chr_tobin_ashgrave","relationship_type":"mentor","description":"Mara Voss reluctantly guides Tobin Ashgrave, a disgraced Warden apprentice, teaching him caution aboard the wreck while clashing with his recklessness."},{"id":"rel_ilse_mara_distrust","source_character_id":"chr_ilse_quill","target_character_id":"chr_mara_voss","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Ilse Quill reluctantly serves under Mara Voss, sharing maps while concealing what she knows, a secret that strains Mara's trust."},{"id":"rel_wren_corvin_fear","source_character_id":"chr_wren_tallow","target_character_id":"chr_corvin_hale","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Wren Tallow fears Corvin Hale as the face of the Cartel grain levy threatening her family, and he exploits her timidity to silence her warnings."},{"id":"rel_tobin_wren_friend","source_character_id":"chr_tobin_ashgrave","target_character_id":"chr_wren_tallow","relationship_type":"friend","description":"Tobin Ashgrave befriends Wren Tallow, shielding her from Corvin Hale and taking her fog-whispers seriously when others dismiss them."}]}
