el.","external_conflict":"Valeria's investigation threatens to trace the funding back to him.","arc":"Moves from confident puppet master to a desperate attempt to cut Thorne loose, and is exposed in the process.","personality_traits":["polished","cold","patient"],"abilities":[{"name":"Ledger Manipulation","description":"Hides payments and debts in routine shipping accounts.","category":"mental"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_valeria_thorne_enemy","source_character_id":"chr_valeria_corvane","target_character_id":"chr_cassian_thorne","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Valeria Corvane is scheming to bring down Cassian Thorne, whose populist rise she believes will destroy the Senate."},{"id":"rel_thorne_rusk_patron","source_character_id":"chr_cassian_thorne","target_character_id":"chr_ilvane_rusk","relationship_type":"client","description":"Cassian Thorne depends on Ilvane Rusk's hidden Cartel funding while pretending it does not exist."},{"id":"rel_rusk_thorne_handler","source_character_id":"chr_ilvane_rusk","target_character_id":"chr_cassian_thorne","relationship_type":"handler","description":"Ilvane Rusk steers Cassian Thorne's campaign through money, and grows afraid of losing control."},{"id":"rel_valeria_orsen_ally","source_character_id":"chr_valeria_corvane","target_character_id":"chr_orsen_fell","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Valeria Corvane seeks the support of Orsen Fell and the Wardens, but hides her full plans, straining their trust."},{"id":"rel_marna_valeria_wary","source_character_id":"chr_marna_oakhand","target_character_id":"chr_valeria_corvane","relationship_type":"wary ally","description":"Marna Oakhand distrusts Valeria Corvane as a disgraced senator, yet may trade grain support for protection from the levy."},{"id":"rel_orsen_thorne_rival","source_character_id":"chr_orsen_fell","target_character_id":"chr_cassian_thorne","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Orsen Fell opposes Cassian Thorne's tolls-and-debt promises, which t