in levy, trying to buy or bind the mill owner who feeds the isles."},{"id":"rel_isolde_mira_ally","source_character_id":"chr_isolde_quill","target_character_id":"chr_mira_vance","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Isolde Quill secretly supplies Mira Vance with charts of failing bridges, giving the Wardens evidence against the Cartel."},{"id":"rel_tamsin_mira_ally","source_character_id":"chr_tamsin_brook","target_character_id":"chr_mira_vance","relationship_type":"friend","description":"Tamsin Brook shelters Mira Vance and supplies grain to Warden crews, though Tamsin's reluctance to fight openly frustrates Mira."}]}
