":"Ilsa starts as a cautious ally of convenience. Cartel retaliation tests her principles, and she commits her Wardens openly to Kessa's cause.","personality_traits":["principled","blunt","protective","stubborn"],"abilities":[{"name":"Cloudstone Braiding","description":"Weaves and repairs skybridge cable under extreme wind.","category":"physical"},{"name":"Structural Insight","description":"Spots weak points in bridges and fortifications.","category":"mental"}]},{"id":"chr_dael_wren","name":"Dael Wren","description":"A young cartographer at Silverspine Academy, thin and ink-stained, with an eidetic memory for shifting skybridge routes. He is curious, anxious, and far too trusting.","role":"supporting","home_location_id":"loc_silverspine","faction_id":"fac_bridge_wardens","motivation":"To prove that open knowledge of the bridge network should belong to everyone.","goal":"Decode the AI seed's route-prediction code and publish a map of every unguarded crossing.","flaw":"Naive honesty leads him to share secrets with the wrong people.","internal_conflict":"He idolizes the Academy's rules but is drawn to Kessa's lawbreaking.","external_conflict":"Academy elders and Cartel agents both want his route maps suppressed or seized.","arc":"Dael moves from timid scholar to a bold witness who stakes his reputation on publishing the truth.","personality_traits":["curious","anxious","earnest","brilliant"],"abilities":[{"name":"Route Memory","description":"Recalls and predicts skybridge drift patterns precisely.","category":"mental"}]},{"id":"chr_hesper_dun","name":"Hesper Dun","description":"A broad, soft-spoken miller of The Hollow with flour-dusted sleeves and a deep laugh that rarely appears now. She leads the Hollow Circle's resistance to the Grain Levy.","role":"supporting","home_location_id":"loc_the_hollow","faction_id":"fac_hollow_circle","motivation":"To keep her isle's grain from being seized by a levy that threatens famine.","goal":"Obtain proof of the Cartel's levy fraud to bring before the other isles.","flaw":"Her fear of conflict makes her hesitate until options run out.","internal_conflict":"She values quiet peace but knows only open defiance will save her people.","external_conflict":"The Cartel's Grain Levy empties her storehouses, and wind-debt collectors press her neighbours.","arc":"Hesper shifts from reluctant bargainer to a defiant leader who rallies the isles behind the leaked evidence.","personality_traits":["warm","patient","fearful","resolute"],"abilities":[{"name":"Community Trust","description":"Rallies farmers and millers across isles with a single appeal.","category":"social"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_orrin_hunts_kessa","source_character_id":"chr_orrin_thale","target_character_id":"chr_kessa_vane","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Orrin Thale hunts Kessa Vane for stealing the AI seed, and sees her as a debtor who must be made an example."},{"id":"rel_kessa_ilsa","source_character_id":"chr_kessa_vane","target_character_id":"chr_ilsa_marrow","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Kessa Vane reluctantly trusts Ilsa Marrow, who offers shelter at Emberroost in exchange for access to the seed."},{"id":"rel_ilsa_dael","source_character_id":"chr_ilsa_marrow","target_character_id":"chr_dael_wren","relationship_type":"mentor","description":"Ilsa Marrow guides Dael Wren in applying his route knowledge to protect the Wardens' bridges."},{"id":"rel_dael_kessa","source_character_id":"chr_dael_wren","target_character_id":"chr_kessa_vane","relationship_type":"friend","description":"Dael Wren admires Kessa Vane's daring and helps her decode the seed, though his honesty endangers her."},{"id":"rel_hesper_orrin","source_character_id":"chr_hesper_dun","target_character_id":"chr_orrin_thale","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Hesper Dun opposes Orrin Thale's enforcement of the Grain Levy and later appeals to his conscience."},{"id":"rel_kessa_hesper","source_character_id":"chr_kessa_vane","target_character_id":"chr_hesper_dun","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Kessa Vane delivers evidence from the seed to Hesper Dun, binding the thief to the Hollow Circle's resistance."}]}
