rel because no honest hand can reach the places the thief has gone.","role":"supporting","home_location_id":"loc_silverspine","faction_id":"fac_bridge_wardens","motivation":"To protect the map that records which skybridges are failing before they collapse and kill travellers.","goal":"Get the chart back and publish a corrected network survey to every isle.","flaw":"Scholarly naivety that makes her trust documents and oaths over people.","internal_conflict":"She wonders whether her own secret shortcuts in the survey made the theft possible.","external_conflict":"Academy elders deny the loss to avoid scandal while the Cartel pressures the Wardens through tolls.","arc":"Orsolya leaves her archive, learns to act outside rules and records, and finds the courage to confess her mistake publicly.","personality_traits":["meticulous","gentle","anxious","principled"],"abilities":[{"name":"Skybridge Cartography","description":"Can reconstruct drift routes and weak points in the cloudstone network from fragments of survey data.","category":"mental"}]},{"id":"chr_dravik_solenne","name":"Dravik Solenne","description":"A silk-coated merchant prince of the Drift Cartel, rings on every finger and a perfumed smile that never reaches his eyes. He commissioned the theft of the map to control which bridges stay open and which tolls rise.","role":"antagonist","home_location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","faction_id":"fac_drift_cartel","motivation":"To make the Cartel the sole arbiter of safe passage, ensuring his house outlasts every rival.","goal":"Keep the map hidden and use its knowledge to force the Wardens and the Hollow Circle to accept higher tolls and levies.","flaw":"Arrogant belief that everything, and everyone, has a price.","internal_conflict":"He privately fears his charter-born power is hollow and one honest act could unravel it.","external_conflict":"The Toll War and Grain Levy have bred open resistance, and Kestrel's pursuit threatens to expose him.","arc":"Dravik tightens his g