e the weakest bridges before the season turns.","flaw":"Distrust of outsiders, especially pirates, which makes him rigid and unforgiving.","internal_conflict":"His oath to the Wardens clashes with his sense that the Wardens' bureaucracy has failed.","external_conflict":"Rising Cartel tolls starve his forge of funds, while Dravik's agents sabotage his shipments.","arc":"Bram sets aside prejudice, forms a hard-won bond with Kestrel, and breaks Warden protocol to save a bridge.","personality_traits":["stoic","loyal","stubborn","careful"],"abilities":[{"name":"Cloudstone Braiding","description":"Reads stress in cloudstone cable and can repair or sever a bridge with minimal tools.","category":"technological"}]},{"id":"chr_ilse_marrow","name":"Ilse Marrow","description":"A leader among the Hollow Circle millers, round-faced and sharp-eyed, who keeps a ledger of every Cartel levy. She offers shelter and intelligence to Kestrel in exchange for a promise to bring the Cartel's secrets to light.","role":"supporting","home_location_id":"loc_the_hollow","faction_id":"fac_hollow_circle","motivation":"To free her people from the Grain Levy that is draining their harvests.","goal":"Use the recovered map to prove Cartel manipulation and end the levy.","flaw":"Her fierce thrift makes her withhold aid until she is sure of repayment.","internal_conflict":"She feels guilty for once paying the levy quietly to protect her village.","external_conflict":"Cartel collectors threaten to seize the windmills if she resists.","arc":"Ilse turns from cautious bargaining to open defiance, rallying the isle to stand with Kestrel.","personality_traits":["shrewd","warm","tough","patient"],"abilities":[{"name":"Ledger Memory","description":"Recalls every levy, debt and shipment and spots forged accounts.","category":"mental"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_kestrel_dravik","source_character_id":"chr_kestrel_vane","target_character_id":"chr_dravik_solenne","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Kestrel Vane raided Dravik Solenne's cargo lanes for years, and he now holds her wind-debts over her while hiding the stolen map she hunts."},{"id":"rel_dravik_kestrel","source_character_id":"chr_dravik_solenne","target_character_id":"chr_kestrel_vane","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Dravik Solenne sees Kestrel Vane as a debtor to be crushed and a threat to the map's secrecy, and sends enforcers after her."},{"id":"rel_orsolya_kestrel","source_character_id":"chr_orsolya_thane","target_character_id":"chr_kestrel_vane","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Orsolya Thane hires Kestrel Vane to recover the map, trusting a reformed pirate where the Academy and Wardens cannot act."},{"id":"rel_tamsin_kestrel","source_character_id":"chr_tamsin_rook","target_character_id":"chr_kestrel_vane","relationship_type":"mentor","description":"Tamsin Rook looks up to Kestrel Vane as a mentor, though she is torn between copying her piracy and following her new path."},{"id":"rel_bram_kestrel","source_character_id":"chr_bram_ashdown","target_character_id":"chr_kestrel_vane","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Bram Ashdown distrusts Kestrel Vane for her pirate past and challenges her at every step, until shared danger forges respect."},{"id":"rel_ilse_dravik","source_character_id":"chr_ilse_marrow","target_character_id":"chr_dravik_solenne","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Ilse Marrow opposes Dravik Solenne's Grain Levy and seeks the map to expose his manipulation of the Hollow Circle."},{"id":"rel_orsolya_bram","source_character_id":"chr_orsolya_thane","target_character_id":"chr_bram_ashdown","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Orsolya Thane and Bram Ashdown are fellow Bridge Wardens who rely on each other to turn the recovered map into real bridge repairs."}]}
