el's levy.","role":"supporting","home_location_id":"loc_the_hollow","faction_id":"fac_hollow_circle","motivation":"To protect his community's grain from being claimed by the levy.","goal":"Get his grain shipment to market without paying the full Cartel levy.","flaw":"He is distrustful of outsiders and slow to forgive.","internal_conflict":"He wants to stay out of conflict yet feels compelled to defend his neighbours.","external_conflict":"Cartel collectors shadow the caravan to seize his grain.","arc":"Garrick learns to trust the caravan crew and becomes a loyal defender who speaks for the Hollow Circle at the peace table.","personality_traits":["steady","blunt","loyal","wary"],"abilities":[{"name":"Windmill Strength","description":"Lifts and hauls heavy grain loads tirelessly.","category":"physical"}]},{"id":"chr_corvin_dray","name":"Corvin Dray","description":"A polished Drift Cartel factor in a crimson-trimmed coat, ambitious and charming, charged with collecting tolls and levies along the caravan's route.","role":"antagonist","home_location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","faction_id":"fac_drift_cartel","motivation":"To rise to a seat among the Cartel's merchant princes by maximising toll revenue.","goal":"Seize the caravan's cargo and force the Wardens to concede to higher tolls.","flaw":"His pride cannot tolerate being outmanoeuvred, making him vindictive.","internal_conflict":"He privately admires Mara's integrity while resenting it.","external_conflict":"Wardens and the Hollow Circle resist the tolls he enforces, endangering his promotion.","arc":"Corvin escalates his schemes, loses standing when they backfire, and is left to choose between his ambition and a grudging honesty.","personality_traits":["charming","ambitious","calculating","proud"],"abilities":[{"name":"Silver Tongue","description":"Persuades and pressures officials and merchants alike.","category":"social"},{"name":"Ledger Mastery","description":"Tracks debts and wind-debt claims with perfect recall.",