{"world_id":"wld_aetheria","characters":[{"id":"chr_mara_veln","name":"Mara Veln","description":"A weathered caravan-mistress in her late thirties who inherited a family string of skyskiffs and cloudstone-hauling wagons from her father. She wears a patched indigo coat, keeps a brass wind-gauge at her belt, and is known at every dock for her laugh and her honest scales.","role":"protagonist","home_location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","faction_id":"fac_drift_cartel","motivation":"To keep her late father's caravan alive and her crew fed through the seasons.","goal":"Deliver a crucial cargo of forge-cable across the skybridges and clear the caravan's mounting wind-debt before the season ends.","flaw":"She cannot refuse anyone in need, even when it endangers her crew.","internal_conflict":"She is torn between loyalty to the Cartel that raised her and her conscience about its rising tolls.","external_conflict":"The Toll War makes every skybridge crossing costlier and more dangerous for her caravan.","arc":"Mara learns that neutrality is not safety, and rises from a reluctant trader into a negotiator who brokers peace between the Cartel and the Wardens.","personality_traits":["warm","stubborn","generous","shrewd"],"abilities":[{"name":"Wind Reading","description":"Predicts gusts and drift patterns along skybridge routes.","category":"physical"},{"name":"Haggling","description":"Bargains debts and cargo prices with uncanny skill.","category":"social"}]},{"id":"chr_tobin_ash","name":"Tobin Ash","description":"A lanky young cable-braider apprenticed at Emberroost, soot-smudged and perpetually humming. He joins the caravan to escape his master's shadow, carrying a braiding kit and a notebook of cable knots.","role":"supporting","home_location_id":"loc_emberroost","faction_id":"fac_bridge_wardens","motivation":"To prove he is more than a forge apprentice and earn the Wardens' full sworn status.","goal":"Inspect and repair frayed skybridge cables along the caravan's route.","flaw":"He is reckless with his own safety and overconfident in his craft.","internal_conflict":"He values the Wardens' oath yet grows to love the freedom of the road.","external_conflict":"Cartel tolls and sabotage threaten the very cables he is sworn to protect.","arc":"Tobin matures from a boastful apprentice into a careful, trusted Warden who chooses duty and caution over glory.","personality_traits":["curious","eager","cheerful","impulsive"],"abilities":[{"name":"Cloudstone Braiding","description":"Repairs and strengthens skybridge cables on the move.","category":"technological"},{"name":"Spark Discipline","description":"Handles forge tools safely under the no-open-flame rule.","category":"physical"}]},{"id":"chr_isolde_quill","name":"Isolde Quill","description":"A soft-spoken cartographer from Silverspine Academy, silver-haired and ink-stained, who joins the caravan to chart a shifting skybridge route no map yet records.","role":"supporting","home_location_id":"loc_silverspine","faction_id":"fac_bridge_wardens","motivation":"To complete the first true chart of the drifting skybridge network.","goal":"Map a safe new route that bypasses the Cartel's tolled bridges.","flaw":"She is so absorbed in observation that she overlooks immediate danger and people's feelings.","internal_conflict":"Her scholarly neutrality clashes with her growing desire to take sides.","external_conflict":"A Cartel official wants her charts suppressed to protect toll revenue.","arc":"Isolde moves from detached observer to active ally who uses her maps to protect the caravan and the isles.","personality_traits":["precise","gentle","absent-minded","observant"],"abilities":[{"name":"Skybridge Cartography","description":"Charts and predicts the shifting network of bridges.","category":"mental"}]},{"id":"chr_garrick_holt","name":"Garrick Holt","description":"A broad-shouldered Hollow Circle miller with flour-dusted forearms, who travels with the caravan escorting a grain shipment threatened by the Cartel's levy.","role":"supporting","home_location_id":"loc_the_hollow","faction_id":"fac_hollow_circle","motivation":"To protect his community's grain from being claimed by the levy.","goal":"Get his grain shipment to market without paying the full Cartel levy.","flaw":"He is distrustful of outsiders and slow to forgive.","internal_conflict":"He wants to stay out of conflict yet feels compelled to defend his neighbours.","external_conflict":"Cartel collectors shadow the caravan to seize his grain.","arc":"Garrick learns to trust the caravan crew and becomes a loyal defender who speaks for the Hollow Circle at the peace table.","personality_traits":["steady","blunt","loyal","wary"],"abilities":[{"name":"Windmill Strength","description":"Lifts and hauls heavy grain loads tirelessly.","category":"physical"}]},{"id":"chr_corvin_dray","name":"Corvin Dray","description":"A polished Drift Cartel factor in a crimson-trimmed coat, ambitious and charming, charged with collecting tolls and levies along the caravan's route.","role":"antagonist","home_location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","faction_id":"fac_drift_cartel","motivation":"To rise to a seat among the Cartel's merchant princes by maximising toll revenue.","goal":"Seize the caravan's cargo and force the Wardens to concede to higher tolls.","flaw":"His pride cannot tolerate being outmanoeuvred, making him vindictive.","internal_conflict":"He privately admires Mara's integrity while resenting it.","external_conflict":"Wardens and the Hollow Circle resist the tolls he enforces, endangering his promotion.","arc":"Corvin escalates his schemes, loses standing when they backfire, and is left to choose between his ambition and a grudging honesty.","personality_traits":["charming","ambitious","calculating","proud"],"abilities":[{"name":"Silver Tongue","description":"Persuades and pressures officials and merchants alike.","category":"social"},{"name":"Ledger Mastery","description":"Tracks debts and wind-debt claims with perfect recall.","category":"mental"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_mara_corvin_rival","source_character_id":"chr_mara_veln","target_character_id":"chr_corvin_dray","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Mara Veln and Corvin Dray grew up on the same docks; he now enforces Cartel tolls that threaten her caravan, while she refuses to cheat or bow to him."},{"id":"rel_corvin_mara_enemy","source_character_id":"chr_corvin_dray","target_character_id":"chr_mara_veln","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Corvin Dray targets Mara Veln's cargo to force Wardens into paying higher tolls, though he secretly respects her honesty."},{"id":"rel_mara_tobin_mentor","source_character_id":"chr_mara_veln","target_character_id":"chr_tobin_ash","relationship_type":"mentor","description":"Mara Veln takes Tobin Ash under her wing, teaching him caution and the ways of the road while he repairs her caravan's route."},{"id":"rel_isolde_mara_ally","source_character_id":"chr_isolde_quill","target_character_id":"chr_mara_veln","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Isolde Quill provides Mara Veln with charted routes that avoid tolled bridges, while Mara protects her and her maps."},{"id":"rel_garrick_corvin_enemy","source_character_id":"chr_garrick_holt","target_character_id":"chr_corvin_dray","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Garrick Holt resists the grain levy that Corvin Dray tries to collect from his shipment."},{"id":"rel_tobin_isolde_friend","source_character_id":"chr_tobin_ash","target_character_id":"chr_isolde_quill","relationship_type":"friend","description":"Tobin Ash and Isolde Quill, both Warden-aligned, bond over cables and charts and look out for each other on the road."}]}
